# Claude Code's local session state: its settings and the git worktrees agents
# create while working. Never part of a build or an image. Untracked, it also
# made every protected deployment fail: readSourceRevision runs `git status
# --untracked-files=normal` and refuses to deploy on any output, so a fresh
# clone could not deploy at all until this was ignored.
.claude/

# Maestro writes per-run debug output and device logs next to the retained
# evidence. Only the JUnit results and screenshots are evidence.
.verification/**/debug/
.verification/**/artifacts/
.verification/**/playwright-artifacts/

# Tenant values kept out of the public repository (see docs/CONFIGURATION.md)
# and the availability-zone cache CDK writes next to them, whose keys embed
# the account ID.
infra/cdk.local.json
infra/cdk.context.json
